OL,3,GNEWSA'We're paying the price' to park
OL,4,Aat beauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has criticised Birmingham City
OL,7,FCouncil for introducing parking charges
OL,8,Fat Lickey Hills Country Park while
OL,9,Fshelving similar proposals for Sutton
OL,10,FPark and Sheldon Country Park.
OL,12,FThe authority had originally proposed
OL,13,Fcharges at the three beauty spots to
OL,14,Fhelp cover maintenance costs after it
OL,15,Fdeclared itself bankrupt in 2023. The
OL,16,Fmove triggered a wave of anger.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
